              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mĩthenya ĩsu Esekia aĩ mũwau akathengeea kũkw’a. Na mwathani Isaia, mwana wa Amosu, amũkĩa, na amwĩa, Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova ũnũkwasya, Ĩae ũndũ wa nyũmba yaku; nũndũ nũũkw’a, ndwĩĩkala thayũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
