              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Isaia amwĩa Esekia, Ĩthukĩĩsye ndeto ya Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisya, mĩthenya nĩyũkĩte, yĩla kyonthe kĩ nyũmbanĩ yaku, na kĩla aaĩthe maku maiĩte kũvika ũmũnthĩ, kĩkatwawa Mbaviloni: vati kĩndũ kĩkatiala, easya ũu Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
